  "body": "Relaxed Coastal Luxury with Rare Global Appeal\r\n\r\nPositioned directly on Milford’s golden beachfront, this beautiful coastal home captures everything people dream of when they imagine a beachfront lifestyle - effortless living with breathtaking views and sun kissed days, more reminiscent of a holiday destination than suburban Auckland.\r\n\r\nAdding another layer of rarity, this property qualifies for the Active Investor Plus (AIP) visa pathway - making it one of very few absolute beachfront homes in New Zealand that offers both an extraordinary lifestyle and a compelling opportunity for international buyers.\r\n\r\nElevated just above the sand, the home enjoys direct beach access via a private garden gate and a short flight of steps leading straight to the sand. From sunrise over Rangitoto to the ever-changing colours and moods of the ocean at sunset, the outlook is simply captivating, stretching to include the surrounding gulf islands. With a prized northerly aspect, this home is beautifully positioned for sun throughout the year. \r\n\r\n The home is designed for relaxed family living and effortless entertaining, the interiors have been thoughtfully opened up to create expansive flowing living spaces. The generous kitchen forms the heart of the home, connecting seamlessly to open-plan dining and living areas, which include a big open lounge with a large feature fire and a light-filled conservatory-style living room opening to the sun-soaked outdoor terraces overlooking the sea.\r\n\r\nLarge skylights invite additional natural light throughout the home, while the simple, beautifully considered landscaping ensures the focus remains exactly where it should be - on the extraordinary waterfront position and spectacular views. The grounds are intentionally low-maintenance, creating an easy-care lock-and-leave lifestyle rarely found in a true beachfront setting.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation is well configured for families, guests, or extended stays, with two upstairs ensuite bedrooms including a beautiful master retreat, while two additional bedrooms are positioned on the main level. Double internal access garaging, plus additional off-street parking, completes the practical appeal.\r\n\r\nBeyond the home itself lies one of Auckland’s most tightly held coastal communities. Stroll along the beach to Milford’s vibrant village, with its boutiques, cafés, restaurants and shopping mall all within easy walking distance. Milford’s tidal marina, excellent motorway access to Auckland CBD and convenient routes north add further lifestyle ease.\r\n\r\nRelaxed, warm and inviting this is undeniably special - it is beachfront living at its most effortless.",
